sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Clin as Clinician
    participant Lab as LaboratoryService
    participant Num as LabNumbering
    participant Inv as Inventory/Phlebotomy
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Audit as AuditService

    Clin->>Lab: Create LabOrder (patientId, encounterId, items)
    Lab->>Num: nextLabSequence for order
    Num-->>Lab: seq -> LAB-ORD-YYYY-NNNNNN
    Lab->>DB: Create LabOrder + LabOrderItems
    Lab->>Audit: audit lab_order.created
    Lab-->>Clin: Order created
    Inv->>Lab: Collect sample
    Lab->>Num: nextLabSequence for sample
    Num-->>Lab: seq -> LAB-SMP-YYYY-NNNNNN
    Lab->>DB: Create LabSample linked to order
    Lab->>Audit: audit lab_sample.collected
    Inv->>Lab: Enter results
    Lab->>DB: Create LabResult(s) for sample/items
    Lab->>DB: Update LabOrder/LabSample status
    Lab->>Audit: audit lab_result.entered
    Note over Lab: Org/branch scoped; results visible per permissions
